	(text "BSS138 Ciss is 50pF typ, creating an RC time constant of 5ns typ \nwith R32 (100Ω). R63 (10kΩ) pulls gate low when input is floating; \nthe 100:1 ratio ensures full Vgs swing (3.27V / 4.95V for \n3.3V / 5V input), well above the BSS138 Vgs(th) max of 1.5V. Rds(on) \nis characterized at Vgs = 2.5V (3.8Ω max), guaranteeing correct \noperation with 3.3V CMOS 1PPS sources. Load current through Q3 is \n~3.3mA (3V3 / R31 1kΩ), giving Vol well below MCU VIL even at maximum \nRds(on). Compatible with 3.3V and 5V 1PPS sources. Signal to MCU is inverted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 74.93 75.692 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "787c1acd-fc5a-471a-9bc1-bbf7b0f3062f")
	)
	(text "Tx"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240.03 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "bf9cdb36-11e9-4c2a-bb49-92d66d397f3d")
	)
